---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout title="Contact Us - PasteDownloadApp" description="Contact the PasteDownloadApp team. Get in touch with questions, feedback, or support requests about our free image downloader tool." canonicalUrl="https://pastedownloadapp.com/contact/" breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", href: "/" }, { name: "Contact" }]}>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "ContactPage",
      "name": "Contact Us - PasteDownloadApp",
      "description": "Contact the PasteDownloadApp team. Get in touch with questions, feedback, or support requests.",
      "mainEntity": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "PasteDownloadApp",
        "url": "https://pastedownloadapp.com/",
        "contactPoint": {
          "@type": "ContactPoint",
          "contactType": "customer support",
          "email": "hello@pastedownloadapp.com"
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

  <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-[28px] font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight mt-0 mb-6 leading-tight text-balance">
    Contact Us
  </h1>

  <div class="text-body text-base sm:text-[17px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 [&_h2]:text-ink [&_h2]:text-lg [&_h2]:sm:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:mt-8 [&_h2]:mb-2 [&_h2]:leading-tight [&_h3]:text-ink [&_h3]:text-base [&_h3]:sm:text-lg [&_h3]:font-semibold [&_h3]:tracking-tight [&_h3]:mt-6 [&_h3]:mb-2 [&_h3]:leading-tight [&_a]:text-link [&_a]:underline [&_a]:underline-offset-2 [&_a]:decoration-link/30 [&_a]:transition-colors [&_a:hover]:decoration-link">
    <p>
      Have a question, suggestion, or need help? We would love to hear from you. PasteDownloadApp is built to be simple and dependable, and the fastest way to keep it that way is hearing directly from the people who use it. Here are the best ways to reach us, along with a few things that help us respond faster.
    </p>

    <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-link-bg-soft flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-ink text-sm font-semibold m-0">Email</p>
          <a href="mailto:hello@pastedownloadapp.com" class="text-link text-sm no-underline hover:underline">hello@pastedownloadapp.com</a>
          <p class="text-mute text-xs mt-0.5 m-0">We typically respond within 1&ndash;2 business days.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Send Us a Message</h2>
    <p>Prefer a form over email? Fill this out and it goes straight to our inbox.</p>

    <div id="contactSuccessBanner" class="hidden rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft p-4 text-ink text-sm" role="status" aria-live="polite">
      Thanks, your message is on its way. We typically respond within 1&ndash;2 business days.
    </div>

    <form id="contactForm" action="https://formsubmit.co/hello@pastedownloadapp.com" method="POST" class="space-y-4">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New message from PasteDownloadApp contact form" />
      <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
      <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://pastedownloadapp.com/contact/?sent=true" />
      <input type="text" name="_honey" class="hidden" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div>
          <label for="contactName" class="block text-ink text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">Name</label>
          <input id="contactName" type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name" class="w-full h-10 sm:h-11 px-3 sm:px-4 text-sm text-ink bg-canvas border border-hairline dark:border-hairline-strong rounded-lg outline-none focus:border-hairline-strong transition-colors placeholder:text-mute focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-link" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="contactEmail" class="block text-ink text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">Email</label>
          <input id="contactEmail" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" class="w-full h-10 sm:h-11 px-3 sm:px-4 text-sm text-ink bg-canvas border border-hairline dark:border-hairline-strong rounded-lg outline-none focus:border-hairline-strong transition-colors placeholder:text-mute focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-link" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="contactSubject" class="block text-ink text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">Subject</label>
        <input id="contactSubject" type="text" name="subject" placeholder="What's this about?" class="w-full h-10 sm:h-11 px-3 sm:px-4 text-sm text-ink bg-canvas border border-hairline dark:border-hairline-strong rounded-lg outline-none focus:border-hairline-strong transition-colors placeholder:text-mute focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-link" />
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="contactMessage" class="block text-ink text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">Message</label>
        <textarea id="contactMessage" name="message" required rows="5" placeholder="Bug reports, feature ideas, or anything else." class="w-full px-3 sm:px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink bg-canvas border border-hairline dark:border-hairline-strong rounded-lg outline-none focus:border-hairline-strong transition-colors placeholder:text-mute focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-link resize-y"></textarea>
      </div>

      <button type="submit" class="bg-ink dark:bg-white text-on-primary dark:text-black text-sm font-medium px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity border-none cursor-pointer focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-link focus-visible:outline-none">
        Send Message
      </button>
    </form>

    <h2>Before You Reach Out</h2>
    <p>
      A lot of support questions come down to browser permissions or network conditions rather than a bug in the tool itself. Checking a few things first often gets you back to downloading images faster than waiting on a reply:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
      <li><strong>Clipboard permission blocked:</strong> Some browsers ask for explicit permission before a page can read from the clipboard. If paste is not working, check your browser's site settings and confirm clipboard access is allowed for pastedownloadapp.com.</li>
      <li><strong>Paste shortcut not registering:</strong> Click inside the paste area first so it has focus, then use Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on macOS). Clicking outside the drop zone before pasting is the most common reason nothing happens.</li>
      <li><strong>Downloaded file looks different from the original:</strong> Converting between formats, such as PNG to JPEG, can change file size and sometimes introduce compression artifacts. Choosing the same format as the source image avoids this entirely.</li>
      <li><strong>Nothing happens after pasting:</strong> Confirm your clipboard actually contains image data and not just a file path or a copied link. Some applications copy a reference to an image rather than the image itself.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Frequently Requested Topics</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
      <li><strong>Bug reports:</strong> Please include your browser name and version, your operating system, and the exact steps that led to the problem. A screenshot of any error message is especially useful.</li>
      <li><strong>Feature requests:</strong> We welcome suggestions for new output formats, keyboard shortcuts, or workflow improvements. Tell us the specific situation the feature would solve, not just the feature itself, since that context usually shapes how we build it.</li>
      <li><strong>Privacy questions:</strong> See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details on how we handle your data, including which third-party services are involved and why.</li>
      <li><strong>General inquiries:</strong> For anything else, just send us an email and we will point you in the right direction.</li>
      <li><strong>Accessibility feedback:</strong> If any part of the site is hard to use with a screen reader, keyboard-only navigation, or other assistive technology, tell us exactly where it happened so we can fix it.</li>
      <li><strong>Removal requests:</strong> If you believe an image handled through the tool infringes your copyright, contact us with details and we will look into it.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Response Times and What to Expect</h2>
    <p>
      This project does not run a dedicated support team, so replies come from the same person who builds and maintains the tool. Most emails get a response within one to two business days. Bug reports with clear reproduction steps are usually the fastest to resolve, since there is no back and forth needed to understand what went wrong. Feature requests take a bit longer to answer meaningfully, because a real answer means thinking through whether the idea fits the tool's scope, not just replying to acknowledge the email.
    </p>

    <h2>Reporting a Security Issue</h2>
    <p>
      If you believe you have found a security vulnerability, please email us directly instead of posting details publicly. Include enough information to reproduce the issue: the exact steps, the browser and OS involved, and a proof of concept if you have one. We take these reports seriously given the site handles clipboard and file data, even though all processing happens locally in your browser rather than on a server. We will confirm receipt and let you know once a fix is in place.
    </p>

    <h2>Press and Partnership Inquiries</h2>
    <p>
      For press, partnership, or other business-related questions, email us with a short description of what you are looking for. Because this is a small, focused tool rather than a company with a dedicated marketing department, response times for these inquiries may run a little longer than for support requests.
    </p>
  </div>
</ContentLayout>

<script>
  const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
  if (params.get('sent') === 'true') {
    const banner = document.getElementById('contactSuccessBanner');
    if (banner) banner.classList.remove('hidden');

    const url = new URL(window.location.href);
    url.searchParams.delete('sent');
    window.history.replaceState({}, '', url.toString());
  }
</script>
